  "id": "zone-of-optimal-functioning",
  "term": "zone of optimal functioning",
  "definition": "Zone of optimal functioning is an individual range of anxiety-related states in which a person tends to perform best. In the packet’s context, it refers to each performer’s own pattern of cognitive anxiety, physical anxiety, and self-confidence that can be used to estimate how well they may perform.",
